  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The Bar has always struck me as the most esteemed of professions, a field where its practitioners can maintain their dignity, no matter the circumstances.",
      "output_sha256": "ed15d25254448141d005e89ae48ffe9872780f40bae37d0a364cfc1a27c1c1e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.391879,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ba3599bbfb250a83e407383ca2793a2cf612431192270aa1d48d5400bf9ea4f6",
        "8d20b62fc157f5f388e303c926dcf7709c9c1f56ee8bedc566c022aa8af6cf99"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ed15d25254448141d005e89ae48ffe9872780f40bae37d0a364cfc1a27c1c1e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This is not the case with other professions.",
      "output_sha256": "a59884b6476e6ef1778efd149c43e567fa84342fcc6963de4e8422661e77b794",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.391879,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ba3599bbfb250a83e407383ca2793a2cf612431192270aa1d48d5400bf9ea4f6",
        "8d20b62fc157f5f388e303c926dcf7709c9c1f56ee8bedc566c022aa8af6cf99"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a59884b6476e6ef1778efd149c43e567fa84342fcc6963de4e8422661e77b794",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A schoolmaster can be referred to contemptuously as an usher; a doctor is regarded humorously as a licensed murderer; a solicitor is always retiring to gaol for making away with trust funds, and, in any case, is merely an attorney; while a civil servant sleeps from ten to four every day, and is only waked up at sixty in order to be given a pension.",
      "output_sha256": "69631eb1c53f97a64c292c0c2a727cfdfd875559bbc469f611bb93d7f8b7f957",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "69631eb1c53f97a64c292c0c2a727cfdfd875559bbc469f611bb93d7f8b7f957",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But there is no humorous comment to be made upon the barrister—unless it is to call him \"my learned friend.\"",
      "output_sha256": "ffce955889935ba1967e83f3f93db515a9ea5ddb87ca49b898755038c45950c6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "ffce955889935ba1967e83f3f93db515a9ea5ddb87ca49b898755038c45950c6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Their claim to professionalism carries more weight than that of an actor.",
      "output_sha256": "550ee6d00fd51f3fba95bbd0c5bd48144fa21987f9e48da329c81cd335004066",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.343371,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "834ffb28e4a2d4e35178d65c548f6e4a67861d7292bb7b51ad4f530e51b0a6a4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "550ee6d00fd51f3fba95bbd0c5bd48144fa21987f9e48da329c81cd335004066",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I don't know why.",
      "output_sha256": "002327f5e8f557c65d983cb625f6412389a9c00ab230cef5a16a7ffc6f7c357c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "002327f5e8f557c65d983cb625f6412389a9c00ab230cef5a16a7ffc6f7c357c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps it is because he walks about the Temple in a top-hat.",
      "output_sha256": "19773986c17f44eec19621a9a45dcb7790de4ecdc6ca392cbe9283fe90e1b47c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "19773986c17f44eec19621a9a45dcb7790de4ecdc6ca392cbe9283fe90e1b47c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Many of my acquaintances have dabbled in the legal profession, having “eaten dinners” at the Inns of Court, making it challenging to voice any criticism of their chosen path.",
      "output_sha256": "159ad86e6b5d79941e81ace9b194bce5d8e66f2207070d64c36a4b7d3de04284",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.33533,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2685c45c6716d69e71e4001c9c0544c4eb6294912a14226fb1d716be97f326e5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "159ad86e6b5d79941e81ace9b194bce5d8e66f2207070d64c36a4b7d3de04284",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Additionally, one can never be too certain when one might find themselves in need of legal representation.",
      "output_sha256": "2f11f5c1310e340e87237710eb37c95333f75397b7cda48cdb6401a11e47341c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.315314,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ea9b4dfe0a690539ee7f59ba5beaa07e07f7de76b54bc481eb347c228af6fbda"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2f11f5c1310e340e87237710eb37c95333f75397b7cda48cdb6401a11e47341c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "However, I shall take the risk, and put the barrister in the dock.",
      "output_sha256": "8870ba059aecdc0270f357ed8659d3492ffd968f9bda33a59a1acec42f8caa8b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "8870ba059aecdc0270f357ed8659d3492ffd968f9bda33a59a1acec42f8caa8b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "\"Ladies and gentlemen of the jury, consider this well-tailored individual before you.",
      "output_sha256": "3c3479e6b314812989e9630b94ce16f474371d1a5b704980250f8c0a9e37d7fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.54303,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "748b565f3a03d101c83ea62eea280368f57e854e0e836d0a74c31db8818830b6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3c3479e6b314812989e9630b94ce16f474371d1a5b704980250f8c0a9e37d7fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What shall we say about him?\"",
      "output_sha256": "5d6741fbaf9b57e8cc09795ded8d198dbf85f1afd818c9a275e99f9056f6995a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "5d6741fbaf9b57e8cc09795ded8d198dbf85f1afd818c9a275e99f9056f6995a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Let us begin by asking ourselves what we expect from a profession.",
      "output_sha256": "dc24083eb53c30976b520e37bc099305df9fd7ad46088d2edf42d4965b7f9e4e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "dc24083eb53c30976b520e37bc099305df9fd7ad46088d2edf42d4965b7f9e4e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "First and foremost, we undoubtedly seek a livelihood, yet I believe we desire something beyond mere financial compensation.",
      "output_sha256": "3213080d464b5ca8fa1db9473b4a70a2eaa74bb037022c2a1e8b5d52a2650c5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.378571,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b429ea3ef5ca16a9ee64f2ccb9d250c73d9f181a484b0492acb52bf5894a0fea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3213080d464b5ca8fa1db9473b4a70a2eaa74bb037022c2a1e8b5d52a2650c5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If we were offered a thousand a year to walk from Charing Cross to Barnet every day, reasons of poverty might compel us to accept the offer, but we should hardly be proud of our new profession.",
      "output_sha256": "e02241e902d8512011d6d02640bf0f0ba7a7a0fa56b93287463ab5db620c2659",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "e02241e902d8512011d6d02640bf0f0ba7a7a0fa56b93287463ab5db620c2659",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We should prefer to earn a thousand a year by doing some more useful work.",
      "output_sha256": "7994b9783f550db2983d4ce186c470fbbbc5871a6ec2ced039cf00ade03aa32f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "7994b9783f550db2983d4ce186c470fbbbc5871a6ec2ced039cf00ade03aa32f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Indeed, to a man of any fine feeling the profession of Barnet walking would only be tolerable if he could persuade himself that by his exertions he was helping to revive the neglected art of pedestrianism, or to make more popular the neglected beauties of Barnet; if he could hope that, after his three- hundredth journey, inquisitive people would begin to follow him, wondering what he was after, and so come suddenly upon the old Norman church at the cross-roads, or, if they missed this, at any rate upon a much better appetite for their dinner.",
      "output_sha256": "a87b25d3769a4c16cd99117cb7c2b0cea4b7e6ea1a38f57070c4946d343fde6d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "a87b25d3769a4c16cd99117cb7c2b0cea4b7e6ea1a38f57070c4946d343fde6d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That is to say, he would have to persuade himself that he was walking, not only for himself, but also for the community.",
      "output_sha256": "29866abdf1feb92fbe769658535c1eeec45318516fc0bcf47c35d973470be5c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "29866abdf1feb92fbe769658535c1eeec45318516fc0bcf47c35d973470be5c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It seems to me, then, that a profession is a noble or an ignoble one, according as it offers or denies to him who practises it the opportunity of working for some other end than his own advancement.",
      "output_sha256": "98e6a04f7147db9ac7de69c32de0ec9e765ad4952112f2d0e8dd119d8afd8c66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "98e6a04f7147db9ac7de69c32de0ec9e765ad4952112f2d0e8dd119d8afd8c66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A doctor collects fees from his patients, but he is aiming at something more than pounds, shillings, and pence; he is out to put an end to suffering.",
      "output_sha256": "14d983565c4164d817d183f65dd954dae7cdafd2fa57d0d8a812968bbaf0b947",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "14d983565c4164d817d183f65dd954dae7cdafd2fa57d0d8a812968bbaf0b947",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A schoolmaster earns a living by teaching, but he does not feel that he is fighting only for himself; he is a crusader on behalf of education.",
      "output_sha256": "d7ccdea7d894a4ed5fd2e26d8c0839c93bcfb9a88ba0e33a8023ad6f83febbab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "d7ccdea7d894a4ed5fd2e26d8c0839c93bcfb9a88ba0e33a8023ad6f83febbab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Artists, regardless of their chosen medium, seek to convey a message to the world, sharing their truths—which may benefit them but are not solely for their profit.",
      "output_sha256": "177c64afca91865cba69758ecffddda393d012d9d6858acbcabe49823116438a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.371593,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "33385cbc760016ef49b0715ece7c0cac92cf64bfad6a4a29b52e9179c0d0d559"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "177c64afca91865cba69758ecffddda393d012d9d6858acbcabe49823116438a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "All these and a thousand other ways of living have something of nobility in them.",
      "output_sha256": "ac29bf58c908c39d5c89a2f9220c412f7bd745483808051fde252c32f61b7b23",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "ac29bf58c908c39d5c89a2f9220c412f7bd745483808051fde252c32f61b7b23",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We enter them full of high resolves.",
      "output_sha256": "d80ae92c9f8fa82a91a47214b9460644d6430d82d830c60a38fa8c1eccc5e0cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "d80ae92c9f8fa82a91a47214b9460644d6430d82d830c60a38fa8c1eccc5e0cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We tell ourselves that we will follow the light as it has been revealed to us; that our ideals shall never be lowered; that we will refuse to sacrifice our principles to our interests.",
      "output_sha256": "e837c22cbab9261f098b5e08554e44576b20e9c4c8d97016a0b7d20a1b46ad85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "e837c22cbab9261f098b5e08554e44576b20e9c4c8d97016a0b7d20a1b46ad85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, we inevitably stumble.",
      "output_sha256": "ead4bf3244a6f44bc5f03033a68c06f955a626fffe7f9e70cc43375cbddaddc7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.3125,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "255dd23030e0f8ca99e7846ba2855bc37731a5a2d5602fb4bbfbcf1884645102"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ead4bf3244a6f44bc5f03033a68c06f955a626fffe7f9e70cc43375cbddaddc7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The painter, lured by financial success, churns out repetitive works.",
      "output_sha256": "140e3ec6d3cd9a4866ee590a51894d61768c0c4bff6f6f0e72c51806d0a14920",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.267647,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9044cb2266a62cdc3d5e0b81f1c02a289db2b9eb0bb32250966a7e6b6219f1ad"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "140e3ec6d3cd9a4866ee590a51894d61768c0c4bff6f6f0e72c51806d0a14920",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The doctor neglects research and cultivates instead a bedside manner.",
      "output_sha256": "6f2de7ce4e0b0c3127181bdef1a41669590b796df0542dcd20146b423b067ebc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "6f2de7ce4e0b0c3127181bdef1a41669590b796df0542dcd20146b423b067ebc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The schoolmaster drops all his theories of education and conforms hastily to those of his employers.",
      "output_sha256": "37b8d6e5c651d5e329e553baf614ae25a92b67cac4fbe42a597082cfc098dbb6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "37b8d6e5c651d5e329e553baf614ae25a92b67cac4fbe42a597082cfc098dbb6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We fail, but it is not because the profession is an ignoble one; we had our chances.",
      "output_sha256": "9c320521af8c86a44f3d659cda7f84e9bb1a00028ab6e358f761cfa18f3c507e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c320521af8c86a44f3d659cda7f84e9bb1a00028ab6e358f761cfa18f3c507e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Indeed, the light is still there for those who look.",
      "output_sha256": "0e356d1a948483e398a28434dee22358fc04e5b2e7c910628f741082f894e3f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "0e356d1a948483e398a28434dee22358fc04e5b2e7c910628f741082f894e3f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It beckons to us.",
      "output_sha256": "6c32304e78aa4eb798f847f16b03e19e0d6f10a803144e3818feb2596a1be711",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "6c32304e78aa4eb798f847f16b03e19e0d6f10a803144e3818feb2596a1be711",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Now, what about the Bar?",
      "output_sha256": "638e83122270c0944fb089d7ba50274d5e751d312d80c1dd7b18df72f69b999c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.835,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ff98b0c03821abc56728e5543032baad2f234d70dd61f847262beb2ba4e4297e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "638e83122270c0944fb089d7ba50274d5e751d312d80c1dd7b18df72f69b999c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Does a barrister strive for anything beyond personal advancement?",
      "output_sha256": "dc93cfaab7cc246b33214e918fd00e0c3b9b01d9a826288f76fd6c4018716cdb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.403923,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b7d57e35fe8d506ef8401cfa471f10d1f58e5c6cf659082537fe5e9ddca94be2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dc93cfaab7cc246b33214e918fd00e0c3b9b01d9a826288f76fd6c4018716cdb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He follows what gleam?",
      "output_sha256": "09617236e466ffafe7946131b4383058f3782b4d6f1a4e87d9244378b58c83f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "09617236e466ffafe7946131b4383058f3782b4d6f1a4e87d9244378b58c83f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What are his ideals?",
      "output_sha256": "496360678a02c99e2fc450a58de9581b391bd4b5eb79dab2289098089c5215d7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "496360678a02c99e2fc450a58de9581b391bd4b5eb79dab2289098089c5215d7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It matters little whether they succeed more or less frequently than others in reaching these ideals; what I seek to understand is what motivates them.",
      "output_sha256": "69a7afbcf84530cbf5e293421ce5305359c676eff4bca164cdd40de22521d610",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.387022,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c11e5d38651e0864e11e03bace45d486c97659a9dde8e605d35aebd778e1f8e5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "69a7afbcf84530cbf5e293421ce5305359c676eff4bca164cdd40de22521d610",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I only want to know what it is that he is after.",
      "output_sha256": "b97ddb7fbcfb9d0337573d4f4cb0f45bbc1b80e451767f3b0486a1ed64af8c56",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "b97ddb7fbcfb9d0337573d4f4cb0f45bbc1b80e451767f3b0486a1ed64af8c56",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In the quiet hours when we are alone with ourselves and there is nobody to tell us what fine fellows we are, we come sometimes upon a weak moment in which we wonder, not how much money we are earning, nor how famous we are becoming, but what good we are doing.",
      "output_sha256": "3f7b75e74de9b3604853aa5a6fb227f2772f694b1d7d9f38e393de25fe900451",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f7b75e74de9b3604853aa5a6fb227f2772f694b1d7d9f38e393de25fe900451",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If a barrister experiences such an introspective moment, what reassurance can they draw from it?",
      "output_sha256": "f153d0a4981d5956c96879d9eed999f6e034f59407626137ef9ee9bcf0ce82c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.519091,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2d094a0ede2d6982c4c557abc91112449699aebe9c7e2f673c3eec7ad71a7173"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f153d0a4981d5956c96879d9eed999f6e034f59407626137ef9ee9bcf0ce82c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The only solace may lie in the belief that they are contributing to the administration of Justice.",
      "output_sha256": "2d00243cb0951951d4e0e2099171bb87e76179329f5d4f5a95cb4ff720404a8b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.305492,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "48e1ce896b12bd17e36c7087caa620d8a1ee9801caab127ce2e8e965b3405970"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d00243cb0951951d4e0e2099171bb87e76179329f5d4f5a95cb4ff720404a8b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If he is to be proud of his profession, and in that lonely moment tolerant of himself, he must feel that he is taking a noble part in the vindication of legal right, the punishment of legal wrong.",
      "output_sha256": "2702098da227368cb0a170a60d9ec686a3380adb966468588880853c595bd042",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "2702098da227368cb0a170a60d9ec686a3380adb966468588880853c595bd042",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But he must do more than this.",
      "output_sha256": "205f4586bc5af143920058a81414bf381eb267bcc2d049650d780861b0d31364",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "205f4586bc5af143920058a81414bf381eb267bcc2d049650d780861b0d31364",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Just as the doctor, with increased knowledge and experience, becomes a better fighter against disease, advancing himself, no doubt, but advancing also medical science; just as the schoolmaster, having learnt new and better ways of teaching, can now give a better education to his boys, increasing thereby the sum of knowledge; so the barrister must be able to tell himself that the more expert he becomes as an advocate, the better will he be able to help in the administration of this Justice which is his ideal.",
      "output_sha256": "6426b2f91f59d0c6835633733c5b3831b3d9f01c19486aa861dd041fb3e79978",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "6426b2f91f59d0c6835633733c5b3831b3d9f01c19486aa861dd041fb3e79978",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Can he tell himself this?",
      "output_sha256": "d40552388ca252ba15f701804112eed2af0364c99ea4d46a1cf2dc24001d9de9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "d40552388ca252ba15f701804112eed2af0364c99ea4d46a1cf2dc24001d9de9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I do not see how he can.",
      "output_sha256": "c9cb81de67d26de7575e18d1bd6ba1b9ed8b961c1ee46d4678dac05419cd74fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "c9cb81de67d26de7575e18d1bd6ba1b9ed8b961c1ee46d4678dac05419cd74fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "His increased expertness will be of increased service to himself, of increased service to his clients, but no ideal will be the better served by reason of it.",
      "output_sha256": "dfffd75b4798dbc50f56fb4620d98efbcb934c6f55a734335070bf957267eaea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "dfffd75b4798dbc50f56fb4620d98efbcb934c6f55a734335070bf957267eaea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Consider a hypothetical case, Smith v. Jones.",
      "output_sha256": "08ec6955bd61fdf706c817f6cb3d044e981aeccd2a45b746fa80ce2cbd2b4824",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.633333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dcfbacfeb8ae3643bedd7736cd3d218db6565f25d2a28bb11fd8cb2dbc9d47b7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "08ec6955bd61fdf706c817f6cb3d044e981aeccd2a45b746fa80ce2cbd2b4824",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Counsel is briefed for Smith.",
      "output_sha256": "22e6f01f0720ae6f5f68239f3f049c4e8078c72eb28982c4846537c702fd50a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "22e6f01f0720ae6f5f68239f3f049c4e8078c72eb28982c4846537c702fd50a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "After examining the case he tells himself in effect this: \"As far as I can see, the Law is all on the other side.",
      "output_sha256": "5873839ab6a44d99d9340e4972bab1dcfc32e9a4a37ecea94ea7cae552c6dcc5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "5873839ab6a44d99d9340e4972bab1dcfc32e9a4a37ecea94ea7cae552c6dcc5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Luckily, however, sentiment is on our side.",
      "output_sha256": "5df6134b6415eb512efc03705ef1aff6a2a8cfc9b5d2fcea618bdef4a329153a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "5df6134b6415eb512efc03705ef1aff6a2a8cfc9b5d2fcea618bdef4a329153a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Given an impressionable jury, there's just a chance that we might pull it off.",
      "output_sha256": "9d82c061a426a025db3c0418d2465d1ff213cbeb1367b46239d316b4a5a09f8b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "9d82c061a426a025db3c0418d2465d1ff213cbeb1367b46239d316b4a5a09f8b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It's worth trying.\"",
      "output_sha256": "344c2b734530841cf7525cf47c4632205f3e1772f42dd5bbdfad9aa3cfbbeabe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "344c2b734530841cf7525cf47c4632205f3e1772f42dd5bbdfad9aa3cfbbeabe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He proceeds, and if he is sufficiently skilled, he secures a victory.",
      "output_sha256": "5032bd3b33dd70e49ad7aa46a8c5fcae9ceda6c10d1e74626d2e8935cba8d571",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.545833,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9da15fe0554c8bafd66b623c5088431d7d03aa7c843d97356ec81209ba3a4532"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5032bd3b33dd70e49ad7aa46a8c5fcae9ceda6c10d1e74626d2e8935cba8d571",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A triumph for himself, but what has happened to the ideal?",
      "output_sha256": "814372d5cd526a627a54007a6f5b2e8c745dbf9a657dad566ee62689b244b860",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "814372d5cd526a627a54007a6f5b2e8c745dbf9a657dad566ee62689b244b860",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Did he ever contemplate, “I must do my utmost for my client, even if he is in the wrong, and hope for a loss?”",
      "output_sha256": "ddabd4cb7ab44e9da2316fc95738ff88448c68a5e7f17de0b9eaa1137bf42754",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.510707,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "521709b93629ac80dafa71492a23bcfc96c626eabc8ac45162f9947bc264913b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ddabd4cb7ab44e9da2316fc95738ff88448c68a5e7f17de0b9eaa1137bf42754",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I imagine not.",
      "output_sha256": "b1a32625edee6d55201c97fa85a15cdede0691484902e52d9989154eef2fe2c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1a32625edee6d55201c97fa85a15cdede0691484902e52d9989154eef2fe2c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The whole teaching of the Bar is that he must not bother about justice, but only about his own victory.",
      "output_sha256": "22501638aaf363c8484fa06a6651d331a1f9075b00b6f015779c8a49df545778",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "22501638aaf363c8484fa06a6651d331a1f9075b00b6f015779c8a49df545778",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Ultimately, what is the true pursuit of a barrister?",
      "output_sha256": "ce0e81f2a90fbb70aa2dc3718a9f0cb943670179f7122875b9b9f69c20dfa025",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.339048,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9bcd5dc398243eb957dacafc47ee59bdd3038a771716775bda65d3f97f96ba82"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ce0e81f2a90fbb70aa2dc3718a9f0cb943670179f7122875b9b9f69c20dfa025",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "What does the Bar provide beyond the allure of financial rewards?",
      "output_sha256": "20b6dbe96d1d3cd1f0d9ca63e4d298ff8a429147da1d54e28c2063c06e18afd0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.546104,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6ca47f696843ec101fe351335321ff8d302e7f601c5e9c0b45b23c03e47e0933"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "20b6dbe96d1d3cd1f0d9ca63e4d298ff8a429147da1d54e28c2063c06e18afd0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I asked just now what were a barrister's ideals.",
      "output_sha256": "10ee5bb973c1cafed179ebe69ddb07357f00a04bdbaf29612cb295cda66c43ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "10ee5bb973c1cafed179ebe69ddb07357f00a04bdbaf29612cb295cda66c43ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Let’s reframe the question: What does it mean to be an ideal barrister?",
      "output_sha256": "d943731a328a3113ccc57a7d97f4e3a36c9443a41c64b97e47bc179c026eb444",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.359674,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c6e2832276ea2a6fae422ae04ef53872af948e0b99c9a5ef0c8bb7d27877363d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d943731a328a3113ccc57a7d97f4e3a36c9443a41c64b97e47bc179c026eb444",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If we were to casually define an ideal doctor, we wouldn’t necessarily envision a prestigious figure on Harley Street.",
      "output_sha256": "e689b865d0e5fcfc570576ed10398a69f78f96f4e4bf8ced320c5cde101b5997",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": 0.522807,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "78a790a9d57e786c43b89466e3a2fa4cdb62b11b3c82a24f1973c51eb2ce6d81"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e689b865d0e5fcfc570576ed10398a69f78f96f4e4bf8ced320c5cde101b5997",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "An ideal teacher does not equate to the Headmaster of Eton or the proprietor of a lucrative preparatory school.",
      "output_sha256": "937298ebc725c9e1f19823af1c8de71cc366e61b082efd5f5c140b4a4e905565",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": 0.616923,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aabcdd8c7e0af5654541704b414bad7ab17c31f6af6c349ebc25edab65c9cac5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_ai_sha256": "937298ebc725c9e1f19823af1c8de71cc366e61b082efd5f5c140b4a4e905565",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But can there be an ideal barrister other than a successful barrister?",
      "output_sha256": "e3fdc315797130130e95153ac72294e43acb3f7545b36ccc8bd249ef29b51627",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "e3fdc315797130130e95153ac72294e43acb3f7545b36ccc8bd249ef29b51627",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The eager young writer, just beginning a literary career, might fix his eyes upon Francis Thompson rather than upon Sir Hall Caine; the eager young clergyman might dream dreams over the Life of Father Damien more often than over the Life of the Archbishop of Canterbury; but to what star can the eager young barrister hitch his wagon, save to the star of material success?",
      "output_sha256": "abb524c1e84a78057b74863b70dfd7d04dc4cf94ee52f515795a7e5dd6e4b8f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "abb524c1e84a78057b74863b70dfd7d04dc4cf94ee52f515795a7e5dd6e4b8f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If he does not see himself as Sir Edward Carson, it is only because he thinks that perhaps after all Sir John Simon's manner is the more effective.",
      "output_sha256": "70f267ac9d9db645b91637fed672910d9564249222e47df3fe05934274386502",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "70f267ac9d9db645b91637fed672910d9564249222e47df3fe05934274386502",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There may be other answers to the questions I have asked than the answers I have given, but it is no answer to ask me how the law can be administered without barristers.",
      "output_sha256": "c41f483de20bfad90aa1b634f4715d304d86bc05a94affb76d9dbd4cfcf4ce4c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "c41f483de20bfad90aa1b634f4715d304d86bc05a94affb76d9dbd4cfcf4ce4c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I cannot fathom how such a system could function without them, just as I find it hard to imagine how roads could be kept clean without someone to do the work.",
      "output_sha256": "c882d7b59638d7275dd1ed059dfdeea56aba5ec0a0cf3488cb46bd28919a45a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": 0.254973,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        69
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "45221579abd821927f0cb86285da12a0bb1948f5f08ee51db8948f811f5f71f5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c882d7b59638d7275dd1ed059dfdeea56aba5ec0a0cf3488cb46bd28919a45a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        66
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But that would not disqualify me from saying that road- sweeping was an unattractive profession.",
      "output_sha256": "5f45090616914f39126d97beb4eb8df069696c2c8245dc0c3468f8243f03bd87",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 70,
      "source_human_sha256": "5f45090616914f39126d97beb4eb8df069696c2c8245dc0c3468f8243f03bd87",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So also I am entitled to my opinion about the Bar, which is this.",
      "output_sha256": "a01ac533d0a63de0fd942853a4853bd2fba95d4d4299fc8742607f054ed413e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_human_sha256": "a01ac533d0a63de0fd942853a4853bd2fba95d4d4299fc8742607f054ed413e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That because it offers material victories only and never spiritual ones, that because there can be no standard by which its disciples are judged save the earthly standard, that because there is no place within its ranks for the altruist or the idealist—for these reasons the Bar is not one of the noble professions.",
      "output_sha256": "630be1d51fab056d4161cd637cf9df0e92e77582bf57f345790838a65b8db791",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "630be1d51fab056d4161cd637cf9df0e92e77582bf57f345790838a65b8db791",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
